  "contentHtml": "<p>PPT는 7차시 게시물에 있습니다.</p><p>학생들이랑 같이 만들려고 종이현미경(해외직구로 대량 구입), 종이원심분리기 1인 1개로 다 사뒀는데 온라인이라ㅠㅠ</p><p>직접 만들어 볼 사람은 등교하면 교무실로 찾아오라고 전달했습니다. 직접 찾아온 학생들은 집에서 만들어보라고 재료 따로 줬습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아래 두 영상을 시청한 후 zoom에 접속합니다.</span></p><p><b>오후 2시 15분까지</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. Liter of Light (페트병 전구)</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKiOb6tMuA\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKiOb6tMuA</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tPKiOb6tMuA\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bTHbox/hyJbpaw72H/MQauQ26KqnU3kECjU7WI0k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tPKiOb6tMuA\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>2. TED강연:&#160;Lifesaving scientific tools made of paper | Manu Prakash</p><p><b>한글 자막 꼭 켜고 보세요!!</b></p><p><b><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULNPLFrTirQ\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULNPLFrTirQ</a>&#160;</b></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ULNPLFrTirQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/s9QLk/hyJbeNCqgI/QvGKpP8etYPQy6bqkjalj1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=726_152_878_318\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\">